      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The casting decision at the center of the dispute has ignited a broader cultural conflict. Prominent commentators accused the film production of erasing European history, presenting claims of historical erasure. These allegations require evidence and have become the central accusation in a heated public debate. The controversy highlights the tension between verifiable historical claims and interpretive artistic choices, transforming a creative project into a flashpoint for societal debate over cultural heritage.",
