      "id": "p2",
      "text": "In the digital public sphere, a strong public reaction followed the casting announcement. Those arguing for diverse casting offered a rebuttal based on a view of shared heritage, presenting a counter-argument about shared heritage. This defense presents a perspective grounded in inclusive interpretation, challenging the allegations requiring evidence. The ensuing discourse underscores competing claims to cultural heritage, reflecting a fundamental dispute over the interpretation and ownership of classical narratives.",
