    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The dispute venue became a forum for evidence and counter-evidence. Assertions lacking a factual basis clashed with an evidence-based counter-narrative, as the accusation was examined. This intense online engagement has shifted focus from the artistic merit of the film project to a broader ideological conflict. The current state of the controversy is a public debate where the verification of claims remains paramount to distinguishing reasoned criticism from unsubstantiated narrative.",
